1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:23,080
I was having a dream about that day in our second year of high school.

2
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:27,120
The incredible day that brought us together.

3
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:31,320
Please make yourself comfortable, sir.

4
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:34,140
I'll come back to get you once the bride is ready.

5
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,600
It shouldn't be too much longer now.

6
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:41,060
Excuse me. Do you know if the bride's sisters have arrived?

7
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:44,440
Yes. They came quite early, so they've been here a while.

8
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,740
Oh. Right, thanks.

9
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:50,780
Pardon me, sir. The bride is calling for you.

10
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:54,200
What's up?

11
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:57,680
Almost done getting changed. Wait there a sec.

12
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:02,000
By the way, I heard that the girls are here.

13
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,320
Who knows what they've got planned.

14
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:07,480
I swear, those four haven't changed since high school.

15
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:09,080
Still nothing but trouble.

16
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:12,380
I had that same dream again.

17
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:15,400
How many times am I going to revisit that day?

18
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:19,720
It's been permanently etched into my mind.

19
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:26,800
And it was a total nightmare.

20
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:28,960
We're ready!

21
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:34,840
Thought I'd woken up, but looks like I'm still dreaming.

22
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:37,160
Well, what can you do?

23
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,160
I like it.

24
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,160
I like it.

25
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:40,160
I like it.

26
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,160
I like it.

27
00:01:41,160 --> 00:02:11,140
I like it.

28
00:02:11,140 --> 00:02:13,140
Oh

29
00:02:41,140 --> 00:02:43,140
Oh

30
00:03:11,140 --> 00:03:40,260
We win again thanks to the five of you ladies yotsuba in particular well done

31
00:03:40,260 --> 00:03:42,260
You've improved drastically

32
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:44,260
You think so? I'm not sure

33
00:03:44,260 --> 00:03:47,260
Yeah, we're all quintuplets so we're the same right?

34
00:03:47,260 --> 00:03:53,260
Nope sorry I know what I saw the rest of you oughta learn from yotsuba here she's clearly been practicing hard

35
00:03:53,260 --> 00:03:56,260
Learn from me? Wow

36
00:03:56,260 --> 00:04:00,260
We should head down to the shop now that the match is over it'll be closing soon

37
00:04:00,260 --> 00:04:02,260
Have a little shopping trip planned?

38
00:04:02,260 --> 00:04:08,260
Yeah, we're gonna pick out a special present for our mom to celebrate her getting better

39
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:11,260
We've all been saving up to buy her a pretty bouquet

40
00:04:11,260 --> 00:04:14,260
All right time to go get some flowers

41
00:04:14,260 --> 00:04:17,260
Geez you're always so pushy Ichika

42
00:04:17,260 --> 00:04:18,260
Well come on you guys

43
00:04:18,260 --> 00:04:20,260
Yay!

44
00:04:20,260 --> 00:04:22,260
We've gotta pick the most perfect ones

45
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:24,260
What kind do you think she'd like most?

46
00:04:24,260 --> 00:04:28,260
I heard somewhere that you're supposed to get carnations if they're for your mother

47
00:04:28,260 --> 00:04:30,260
Carnations huh? That's weird

48
00:04:30,260 --> 00:04:32,260
Yeah I don't get it but I've heard the same thing before

49
00:04:32,260 --> 00:04:34,260
Yotsuba how much do we have again?

50
00:04:34,260 --> 00:04:36,260
Let me check

51
00:04:36,260 --> 00:04:38,260
I think I dropped our wallet

52
00:04:38,260 --> 00:04:40,260
Huh?

53
00:04:40,260 --> 00:04:42,260
Any luck over there?

54
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:43,260
No there's still no sign of it

55
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:47,260
He had it before the match started so it has to be around here somewhere

56
00:04:47,260 --> 00:04:49,260
I'll go look where we were earlier

57
00:04:51,260 --> 00:04:53,260
Yotsuba

58
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:55,260
But

59
00:04:55,260 --> 00:04:57,260
He lost it

60
00:04:57,260 --> 00:04:59,260
And it's all my fault

61
00:04:59,260 --> 00:05:01,260
What do I do?

62
00:05:05,260 --> 00:05:07,260
I'm sorry everyone

63
00:05:07,260 --> 00:05:08,260
I really messed up

64
00:05:08,260 --> 00:05:10,260
Don't be so hard on yourself

65
00:05:10,260 --> 00:05:13,260
I'm sure that any one of us could've lost it just as easily

66
00:05:13,260 --> 00:05:14,260
Yeah

67
00:05:14,260 --> 00:05:17,260
When we mess up it's on all five of us together

68
00:05:17,260 --> 00:05:19,260
Thank you guys

69
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:23,260
I know it's not what we were planning on but

70
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:26,260
While looking for the wallet I found some pretty flowers

71
00:05:26,260 --> 00:05:27,260
Do you think

72
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:29,260
These might work?

73
00:05:29,260 --> 00:05:30,260
Oh yeah?

74
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:31,260
Wild flowers?

75
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:32,260
Sorry

76
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:35,260
I shouldn't try to act like I can fix it

77
00:05:36,260 --> 00:05:38,260
We found the same ones that you did

78
00:05:38,260 --> 00:05:39,260
All four of us

79
00:05:39,260 --> 00:05:41,260
They really are quintuplets

80
00:05:43,260 --> 00:05:45,260
Hey I'm home

81
00:05:45,260 --> 00:05:49,260
Are you girls asleep already?

82
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:52,260
We're so glad you're better Mom

83
00:05:52,260 --> 00:05:54,260
We got these to celebrate

84
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:56,260
Here you go

85
00:05:56,260 --> 00:05:57,260
We gathered them for you ourselves

86
00:05:57,260 --> 00:05:58,260
That's right

87
00:05:58,260 --> 00:05:59,260
Thanks for working so hard

88
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:01,260
Thanks for everything

89
00:06:01,260 --> 00:06:03,260
Oh she's just standing there

90
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:05,260
Maybe this isn't good enough

91
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:09,260
It's a wonderful gift

92
00:06:09,260 --> 00:06:13,260
But the best present of all is knowing that the five of you are healthy

93
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:15,260
And happy

94
00:06:16,260 --> 00:06:17,260
Thank you

95
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:19,260
My sweet girls

96
00:06:23,260 --> 00:06:25,260
I'd say we're all done here

97
00:06:25,260 --> 00:06:26,260
Let's head home

98
00:06:34,260 --> 00:06:36,260
Do you think Dad was the one who left that bouquet?

99
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:37,260
Not a chance

100
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:49,260
Can't believe the last summer break of our high school career is almost over

101
00:06:49,260 --> 00:06:53,260
And it'll be full speed ahead on festival prep once the second term starts up

102
00:06:53,260 --> 00:06:56,260
You're going to be taking some time off of school aren't you Ichika?

103
00:06:56,260 --> 00:06:59,260
Have to since I've got that movie to shoot

104
00:06:59,260 --> 00:07:01,260
Will you have enough attendance days to graduate?

105
00:07:01,260 --> 00:07:02,260
Yeah I'll be okay

106
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:06,260
Butero says that he'll be giving me some one-on-one tutoring too

107
00:07:06,260 --> 00:07:08,260
Seriously though

108
00:07:09,260 --> 00:07:11,260
I can't believe we're back here again

109
00:07:12,260 --> 00:07:15,260
Kicked out after just six months on our own

110
00:07:15,260 --> 00:07:16,260
Pretty awful luck

111
00:07:16,260 --> 00:07:17,260
Everything's still clean

112
00:07:17,260 --> 00:07:18,260
I wonder if it was Epita

113
00:07:18,260 --> 00:07:19,260
He must have been keeping it up while we were gone

114
00:07:19,260 --> 00:07:20,260
Man, I forgot how big it was

115
00:07:20,260 --> 00:07:21,260
Thanks a lot

116
00:07:21,260 --> 00:07:22,260
I appreciate it

117
00:07:22,260 --> 00:07:23,260
Huh?

118
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:24,260
Itsuki?

119
00:07:24,260 --> 00:07:25,260
What were you up to in the staff office?

120
